        -:  160:// Even if the CPU doesn't need a memory barrier, we need to ensure
        -:  161:// that the compiler doesn't reorder memory accesses across the
        -:  162:// barriers.
        -:  163:#ifndef _GLIBCXX_READ_MEM_BARRIER
